			"notes": "Test build for players who can't spawn a fren because another mod in their pack uses Polymer. This is 1.1.302 plus one fix. The full 1.1.303 release will come to Modrinth later.\n\n**Fixed**\n- `/bot spawn` no longer fails with a NullPointerException when Polymer is installed (directly or bundled inside another mod).\n\n**Install**\nFor Minecraft 1.21.11 with Fabric. Remove your old `frens-*.jar` from the mods folder, then put this jar in. Only keep one Frens jar at a time.\n\nIf anything else goes wrong, post in the Frens Discord #bug-reports with your latest.log.\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Save a bot before /bot despawn removes it by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/35\n* Stop the off-thread painting scan crashing mining prep by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/36\n* Painting guard refuses only the blocks that hold the painting by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/37\n* Keep mining when stone is hidden instead of stopping early by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/38\n* Mining: exploration must actually relocate the bot by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/48\n* Mining stops digging once the requested amount is collected by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/45\n* release: 1.1.299 (37 sandbox-proven PRs) by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/72\n* fix: auto-spawn leaves bots that logged off for the night to the dawn wake by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/2\n* fix: break-free leaves a house by its door before mining out by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/3\n* fix: hide the \"New bots\" button when the server can't take the answer by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/6\n* fix: a bot's second End exit takes the same path as its first by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/7\n* feat(souls): BAD_AT from repeated execution failures by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/9\n* fix: /bot place chest <n> places the next chest beside the last one by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/11\n* fix: a cooking bot walks back to the furnace after losing reach by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/16\n* fix: soul store files are owner-only (0600) on Linux and macOS by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/17\n* fix: a bot's death is noted in its soul journal as a respawn by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/21\n* fix: despawned bots are really removed from the player list in release builds by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/23\n* fix: follow no longer steers a bot while /bot craft walks it by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/27\n* feat: a bot with no blocks hand-digs a staircase out of a pit by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/28\n* feat: combined chest ask — policy layer (need set, bundled request, prompt text), not wired yet by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/30\n* docs: handoff for the 2026-11-05 cloud batch (PRs #6–#34) by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/31\n* fix: /bot follow stop or /bot stay during a task is not undone when the task ends by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/33\n* Static maps written from several threads are now concurrent by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/42\n* Skill workers no longer spawn entities, set blocks or teleport off-thread by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/43\n* BotActions hotbar selectors run on the server thread by @wcfcarolina13 in https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/pull/44\n\n..."
		},
